## Settings Locations

### Primary Settings Locations

| Level | Location | Purpose | Scope |
|-------|----------|---------|-------|
| **User Settings** | `~/.cursor/settings.json` | Global preferences | All projects |
| **Workspace Settings** | `.vscode/settings.json` | Project-specific | Current workspace |
| **CLI Config** | `~/.cursor/cli-config.json` | Claude Code CLI | Terminal usage |
| **Agent Attribution** | Cursor Settings > Agent > Attribution | Claude Code output attribution | CLI agent only |

### User Settings Example

```json
{
  "cursor.agent.mode": "agent",
  "cursor.agent.chatProvider": "anthropic",
  "cursor.agent.chatModel": "claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
  "cursor.agent.agentProvider": "anthropic",
  "cursor.agent.agentModel": "claude-opus-4-20250514",
  "cursor.agent.tabProvider": "openai",
  "cursor.agent.tabModel": "gpt-3.5-turbo",
  "cursor.agent.contextWindow": 128000,
  "cursor.agent.maxTokens": 4096,
  "cursor.agent.customInstructions": "Write clean, well-documented code.",
  "cursor.agent.attribution.enabled": true
}
```

### CLI Config Example

```json
// ~/.cursor/cli-config.json
{
  "apiKey": "cursor_abc123...",
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
  "provider": "anthropic",
  "attribution": {
    "enabled": true,
    "footer": "Powered by Cursor AI"
  }
}
```

