## Attribution Settings

Attribution controls how Claude Code CLI output is credited:

| Setting | Description | Default |
|---------|-------------|---------|
| `cursor.agent.attribution.enabled` | Whether to show attribution in CLI output | `true` |
| `cursor.agent.attribution.footer` | Custom attribution footer text | `"Powered by Cursor"` |

```json
{
  "cursor.agent.attribution": {
    "enabled": true,
    "footer": "Generated by Cursor AI — cursor.com"
  }
}
```

