## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

| Issue | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| Agent uses wrong provider | Settings conflict | Check precedence order; verify workspace settings don't override user |
| Context window too small | Limited by settings | Increase `cursor.agent.contextWindow`; close unnecessary tabs |
| Custom instructions not applied | Saved to wrong location | Ensure instructions are in `cursor.agent.customInstructions`, not general editor settings |
| Agent mode not responding | Disabled in settings | Verify `cursor.agent.mode` is `"agent"` and `askMode.enabled` is `false` |
| High latency on Tab completions | Wrong model selected | Switch Tab model to faster option (Haiku, GPT-3.5) |
| Attribution missing in CLI | `attribution.enabled` is false | Set `cursor.agent.attribution.enabled` to `true` |

### Diagnostic Commands

```bash
# View current CLI agent configuration
claude --env

# List active sessions with configuration
claude --list

# Test agent mode with verbose output
claude --output json "Explain how you're configured"
```

